---
layout: inner.njk
title: "Новини — Ритеил парк Раковски"
description: "Последни новини и обяви от Ритеил парк Раковски."
---

{# ── Page hero ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
<section class="bg-white/80 py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-3 mb-3">
      <span class="mt-1.5 block h-3 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-brand-yellow)]"></span>
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[var(--color-brand-yellow)]">Новини</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
      Последни<br class="hidden sm:block" />
      <span class="text-[var(--color-brand-teal)]">обяви</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      Следете актуалните новини, промоции и съобщения от Ритеил парк Раковски — всичко на едно място.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── News grid ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
<section class="py-14 sm:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {% for post in news.items %}
      <article class="group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-lg shadow-black/[0.07] ring-1 ring-slate-200/60 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-black/[0.12]">
        {# Image #}
        <a href="{{ post.url | url }}" class="block overflow-hidden">
          <div class="news-card__media relative overflow-hidden" style="border-radius: 1.5rem 1.5rem 0 0;">
            <img
              src="{{ post.image | url }}"
              alt="{{ post.title }}"
              class="news-card__img h-52 w-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>
        </a>

        {# Content #}
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3 p-6">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-brand-yellow)]">{{ post.date }}</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold leading-snug text-slate-900 group-hover:text-[var(--color-brand-teal)] transition-colors">
            <a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.title }}</a>
          </h2>
          <p class="flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">{{ post.excerpt | truncate(120) }}</p>
          <a
            href="{{ post.url | url }}"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-brand-teal)] transition group-hover:gap-2.5 mt-2"
          >
            Прочети
            <svg class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M7.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0l5 5a1 1 0 010 1.414l-5 5a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L11.586 10 7.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
